  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comprehensive Protection Monitoring And Strengthening of Emergency Response Initiatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to ensure:
1. DRC conducts protection monitoring to generate evidence-based analysis of protection risks, enabling data-driven decision-making that informs UK programming, advocacy, humanitarian responses, and strategic policy. 
2. DRC facilitates strong access to protection services and humanitarian assistance through timely referrals and emergency cash assistance, especially for the most vulnerable. 
3. DRC supports suddenly displaced communities via MPCA distribution</narrative>
  </description>
